  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 506.03 Sampling Requirements. The owner of a seasonal system shall conduct sampling in accordance with Env-Dw 707 through Env-Dw 711.\n\nSource. #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #14342, eff 8-22-25, EXPIRES: 8-22-35",
